			"- Grant Reminders permission when prompted\r",
			"- Check: `remindctl status` / Request: `remindctl authorize`\r",
			"\r",
			"## When to Use\r",
			"\r",
			"- User mentions \"reminder\" or \"Reminders app\"\r",
			"- Creating personal to-dos with due dates that sync to iOS\r",
			"- Managing Apple Reminders lists\r",
			"- User wants tasks to appear on their iPhone/iPad\r",
			"\r",
			"## When NOT to Use\r",
			"\r",
			"- Scheduling agent alerts → use the cronjob tool instead\r",
			"- Calendar events → use Apple Calendar or Google Calendar\r",
			"- Project task management → use GitHub Issues, Notion, etc.\r",
			"- If user says \"remind me\" but means an agent alert → clarify first\r",
			"\r",
			"## Quick Reference\r",
			"\r",
			"### View Reminders\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"remindctl                    # Today's reminders\r",
			"remindctl today              # Today\r",
			"remindctl tomorrow           # Tomorrow\r",
			"remindctl week               # This week\r",
			"remindctl overdue            # Past due\r",
			"remindctl all                # Everything\r",
			"remindctl 2026-01-04         # Specific date\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Manage Lists\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"remindctl list               # List all lists\r",
			"remindctl list Work          # Show specific list\r",
			"remindctl list Projects --create    # Create list\r",
			"remindctl list Work --delete        # Delete list\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Create Reminders\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"remindctl add \"Buy milk\"\r",
			"remindctl add --title \"Call mom\" --list Personal --due tomorrow\r",
			"remindctl add --title \"Meeting prep\" --due \"2026-02-15 09:00\"\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Complete / Delete\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"remindctl complete 1 2 3          # Complete by ID\r",
			"remindctl delete 4A83 --force     # Delete by ID\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Output Formats\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"remindctl today --json       # JSON for scripting\r",
			"remindctl today --plain      # TSV format\r",
			"remindctl today --quiet      # Counts only\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## Date Formats\r",
			"\r",
			"Accepted by `--due` and date filters:\r",
			"- `today`, `tomorrow`, `yesterday`\r",
			"- `YYYY-MM-DD`\r",
			"- `YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm`\r",
			"- ISO 8601 (`2026-01-04T12:34:56Z`)\r",
