			"- Grant Full Disk Access for terminal (System Settings → Privacy → Full Disk Access)\r",
			"- Grant Automation permission for Messages.app when prompted\r",
			"\r",
			"## When to Use\r",
			"\r",
			"- User asks to send an iMessage or text message\r",
			"- Reading iMessage conversation history\r",
			"- Checking recent Messages.app chats\r",
			"- Sending to phone numbers or Apple IDs\r",
			"\r",
			"## When NOT to Use\r",
			"\r",
			"- Telegram/Discord/Slack/WhatsApp messages → use the appropriate gateway channel\r",
			"- Group chat management (adding/removing members) → not supported\r",
			"- Bulk/mass messaging → always confirm with user first\r",
			"\r",
			"## Quick Reference\r",
			"\r",
			"### List Chats\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"imsg chats --limit 10 --json\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### View History\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"# By chat ID\r",
			"imsg history --chat-id 1 --limit 20 --json\r",
