			"`turkey`, `turtle`, `tux`, `udder`, `vader`, `vader-koala`, `www`\r",
			"\r",
			"### Eye/tongue modifiers\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"cowsay -b \"Borg\"       # =_= eyes\r",
			"cowsay -d \"Dead\"       # x_x eyes\r",
			"cowsay -g \"Greedy\"     # $_$ eyes\r",
			"cowsay -p \"Paranoid\"   # @_@ eyes\r",
			"cowsay -s \"Stoned\"     # *_* eyes\r",
			"cowsay -w \"Wired\"      # O_O eyes\r",
			"cowsay -e \"OO\" \"Msg\"   # Custom eyes\r",
			"cowsay -T \"U \" \"Msg\"   # Custom tongue\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## Tool 4: Boxes (Decorative Borders)\r",
			"\r",
			"Draw decorative ASCII art borders/frames around any text. 70+ built-in designs.\r",
			"\r",
			"### Setup\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"sudo apt install boxes -y    # Debian/Ubuntu\r",
