			"echo \"Hello World\" | boxes -d parchment       # Parchment scroll\r",
			"echo \"Hello World\" | boxes -d cat             # Cat border\r",
			"echo \"Hello World\" | boxes -d dog             # Dog border\r",
			"echo \"Hello World\" | boxes -d unicornsay      # Unicorn\r",
			"echo \"Hello World\" | boxes -d diamonds        # Diamond pattern\r",
			"echo \"Hello World\" | boxes -d c-cmt           # C-style comment\r",
			"echo \"Hello World\" | boxes -d html-cmt        # HTML comment\r",
			"echo \"Hello World\" | boxes -a c               # Center text\r",
			"boxes -l                                       # List all 70+ designs\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Combine with pyfiglet or asciified\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"python3 -m pyfiglet \"HERMES\" -f slant | boxes -d stone\r",
			"# Or without pyfiglet installed:\r",
			"curl -s \"https://asciified.thelicato.io/api/v2/ascii?text=HERMES&font=Slant\" | boxes -d stone\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## Tool 5: TOIlet (Colored Text Art)\r",
			"\r",
			"Like pyfiglet but with ANSI color effects and visual filters. Great for terminal eye candy.\r",
			"\r",
			"### Setup\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"sudo apt install toilet toilet-fonts -y    # Debian/Ubuntu\r",
			"# brew install toilet                      # macOS\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Usage\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"toilet \"Hello World\"                    # Basic text art\r",
			"toilet -f bigmono12 \"Hello\"            # Specific font\r",
			"toilet --gay \"Rainbow!\"                 # Rainbow coloring\r",
			"toilet --metal \"Metal!\"                 # Metallic effect\r",
			"toilet -F border \"Bordered\"             # Add border\r",
			"toilet -F border --gay \"Fancy!\"         # Combined effects\r",
			"toilet -f pagga \"Block\"                 # Block-style font (unique to toilet)\r",
			"toilet -F list                          # List available filters\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Filters\r",
			"\r",
			"`crop`, `gay` (rainbow), `metal`, `flip`, `flop`, `180`, `left`, `right`, `border`\r",
			"\r",
			"**Note**: toilet outputs ANSI escape codes for colors — works in terminals but may not render in all contexts (e.g., plain text files, some chat platforms).\r",
			"\r",
			"## Tool 6: Image to ASCII Art\r",
			"\r",
			"Convert images (PNG, JPEG, GIF, WEBP) to ASCII art.\r",
			"\r",
			"### Option A: ascii-image-converter (recommended, modern)\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"# Install\r",
			"sudo snap install ascii-image-converter\r",
			"# OR: go install github.com/TheZoraiz/ascii-image-converter@latest\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"ascii-image-converter image.png                  # Basic\r",
			"ascii-image-converter image.png -C               # Color output\r",
			"ascii-image-converter image.png -d 60,30         # Set dimensions\r",
			"ascii-image-converter image.png -b               # Braille characters\r",
			"ascii-image-converter image.png -n               # Negative/inverted\r",
			"ascii-image-converter https://url/image.jpg      # Direct URL\r",
			"ascii-image-converter image.png --save-txt out   # Save as text\r",
