			"- A custom particle character set\r",
			"- A novel scene transition or visual moment\r",
			"\r",
			"Don't just pick from the catalog. The catalog is vocabulary — you write the poem.\r",
			"\r",
			"## Workflow\r",
			"\r",
			"### Step 1: Creative Vision\r",
			"\r",
			"Before any code, articulate the creative concept:\r",
			"\r",
			"- **Mood/atmosphere**: What should the viewer feel? Energetic, meditative, chaotic, elegant, ominous?\r",
			"- **Visual story**: What happens over the duration? Build tension? Transform? Dissolve?\r",
			"- **Color world**: Warm/cool? Monochrome? Neon? Earth tones? What's the dominant hue?\r",
			"- **Character texture**: Dense data? Sparse stars? Organic dots? Geometric blocks?\r",
