			"\r",
			"macOS Pillow: `textbbox()` returns wrong height. Use `font.getmetrics()`: `cell_height = ascent + descent`. See `references/troubleshooting.md`.\r",
			"\r",
			"### ffmpeg Pipe Deadlock\r",
			"\r",
			"Never `stderr=subprocess.PIPE` with long-running ffmpeg — buffer fills at 64KB and deadlocks. Redirect to file. See `references/troubleshooting.md`.\r",
