			"| Component | Budget |\r",
			"|-----------|--------|\r",
			"| Feature extraction | 1-5ms |\r",
			"| Effect function | 2-15ms |\r",
			"| Character render | 80-150ms (bottleneck) |\r",
			"| Shader pipeline | 5-25ms |\r",
			"| **Total** | ~100-200ms/frame |\r",
			"\r",
			"## References\r",
			"\r",
			"| File | Contents |\r",
			"|------|----------|\r",
