			"If the user asks for creative, experimental, surprising, or unconventional output, select the strategy that best fits and reason through its steps BEFORE generating code.\r",
			"\r",
			"- **Forced Connections** — when the user wants cross-domain inspiration (\"make it look organic,\" \"industrial aesthetic\")\r",
			"- **Conceptual Blending** — when the user names two things to combine (\"ocean meets music,\" \"space + calligraphy\")\r",
			"- **Oblique Strategies** — when the user is maximally open (\"surprise me,\" \"something I've never seen\")\r",
			"\r",
			"### Forced Connections\r",
			"1. Pick a domain unrelated to the visual goal (weather systems, microbiology, architecture, fluid dynamics, textile weaving)\r",
