			"1. Name two distinct visual/conceptual spaces (e.g., ocean waves + sheet music)\r",
			"2. Map correspondences (crests = high notes, troughs = rests, foam = staccato)\r",
			"3. Blend selectively — keep the most interesting mappings, discard forced ones\r",
