			"\r",
			"## Workflow\r",
			"\r",
			"### Progress Checklist\r",
			"\r",
			"```\r",
			"Comic Progress:\r",
			"- [ ] Step 1: Setup & Analyze\r",
			"  - [ ] 1.1 Analyze content\r",
			"  - [ ] 1.2 Check existing directory\r",
			"- [ ] Step 2: Confirmation - Style & options ⚠️ REQUIRED\r",
			"- [ ] Step 3: Generate storyboard + characters\r",
			"- [ ] Step 4: Review outline (conditional)\r",
			"- [ ] Step 5: Generate prompts\r",
			"- [ ] Step 6: Review prompts (conditional)\r",
			"- [ ] Step 7: Generate images\r",
			"  - [ ] 7.1 Generate character sheet (if needed) → characters/characters.png\r",
			"  - [ ] 7.2 Generate pages (with character descriptions embedded in prompt)\r",
			"- [ ] Step 8: Completion report\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Flow\r",
			"\r",
			"```\r",
			"Input → Analyze → [Check Existing?] → [Confirm: Style + Reviews] → Storyboard → [Review?] → Prompts → [Review?] → Images → Complete\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Step Summary\r",
			"\r",
			"| Step | Action | Key Output |\r",
			"|------|--------|------------|\r",
			"| 1.1 | Analyze content | `analysis.md`, `source-{slug}.md` |\r",
			"| 1.2 | Check existing directory | Handle conflicts |\r",
			"| 2 | Confirm style, focus, audience, reviews | User preferences |\r",
