			"| 4 | Review outline (if requested) | User approval |\r",
			"| 5 | Generate prompts | `prompts/*.md` |\r",
			"| 6 | Review prompts (if requested) | User approval |\r",
			"| 7.1 | Generate character sheet (if needed) | `characters/characters.png` |\r",
			"| 7.2 | Generate pages | `*.png` files |\r",
			"| 8 | Completion report | Summary |\r",
