			"### Step 5: Generate Prompt → `prompts/infographic.md`\r",
			"\r",
			"**Backup rule**: If `prompts/infographic.md` exists, rename to `prompts/infographic-backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\r",
			"\r",
			"**Load references**: Read the selected layout from `references/layouts/<layout>.md` and style from `references/styles/<style>.md`.\r",
			"\r",
			"Combine:\r",
			"1. Layout definition from `references/layouts/<layout>.md`\r",
			"2. Style definition from `references/styles/<style>.md`\r",
			"3. Base template from `references/base-prompt.md`\r",
			"4. Structured content from Step 2\r",
			"5. All text in confirmed language\r",
			"\r",
			"**Aspect ratio resolution** for `{{ASPECT_RATIO}}`:\r",
			"- Named presets → ratio string: landscape→`16:9`, portrait→`9:16`, square→`1:1`\r",
			"- Custom W:H ratios → use as-is (e.g., `3:4`, `4:3`, `2.35:1`)\r",
			"\r",
			"Save the assembled prompt to `prompts/infographic.md` using `file_write`.\r",
			"\r",
			"### Step 6: Generate Image\r",
			"\r",
			"Use the `image_generate` tool with the assembled prompt from Step 5.\r",
			"\r",
			"- Map aspect ratio to image_generate's format: `16:9` → `landscape`, `9:16` → `portrait`, `1:1` → `square`\r",
			"- For custom ratios, pick the closest named aspect\r",
			"- On failure, auto-retry once\r",
			"- Save the resulting image URL/path to the output directory\r",
			"\r",
			"### Step 7: Output Summary\r",
			"\r",
			"Report: topic, layout, style, aspect, language, output path, files created.\r",
			"\r",
			"## References\r",
			"\r",
			"- `references/analysis-framework.md` — Analysis methodology\r",
			"- `references/structured-content-template.md` — Content format\r",
			"- `references/base-prompt.md` — Prompt template\r",
			"- `references/layouts/<layout>.md` — 21 layout definitions\r",
			"- `references/styles/<style>.md` — 21 style definitions\r",
			"\r",
			"## Pitfalls\r",
			"\r",
			"1. **Data integrity is paramount** — never summarize, paraphrase, or alter source statistics. \"73% increase\" must stay \"73% increase\", not \"significant increase\".\r",
			"2. **Strip secrets** — always scan source content for API keys, tokens, or credentials before including in any output file.\r",
			"3. **One message per section** — each infographic section should convey one clear concept. Overloading sections reduces readability.\r",
			"4. **Style consistency** — the style definition from the references file must be applied consistently across the entire infographic. Don't mix styles.\r",
			"5. **image_generate aspect ratios** — the tool only supports `landscape`, `portrait`, and `square`. Custom ratios like `3:4` should map to the nearest option (portrait in that case).",
