			"  Authored by [@purzbeats](https://github.com/purzbeats). Load this whenever\r",
			"  you're starting from an official template.\r",
			"\r",
			"**Scripts (`scripts/`):**\r",
			"\r",
			"| Script | Purpose |\r",
			"|--------|---------|\r",
			"| `_common.py` | Shared HTTP, cloud routing, node catalogs (don't run directly) |\r",
			"| `hardware_check.py` | Probe GPU/VRAM/disk → recommend local vs Comfy Cloud |\r",
			"| `comfyui_setup.sh` | Hardware check + comfy-cli + ComfyUI install + launch + verify |\r",
			"| `extract_schema.py` | Read a workflow → list controllable params + model deps |\r",
			"| `check_deps.py` | Check workflow against running server → list missing nodes/models |\r",
			"| `auto_fix_deps.py` | Run check_deps then `comfy node install` / `comfy model download` |\r",
			"| `run_workflow.py` | Inject params, submit, monitor, download outputs (HTTP or WS) |\r",
			"| `run_batch.py` | Submit a workflow N times with sweeps, parallel up to your tier |\r",
			"| `ws_monitor.py` | Real-time WebSocket viewer for executing jobs (live progress) |\r",
			"| `health_check.py` | Verification checklist runner — comfy-cli + server + models + smoke test |\r",
			"| `fetch_logs.py` | Pull traceback / status messages for a given prompt_id |\r",
			"\r",
			"**Example workflows (`workflows/`):** SD 1.5, SDXL, Flux Dev, SDXL img2img,\r",
			"SDXL inpaint, ESRGAN upscale, AnimateDiff video, Wan T2V. See\r",
			"`workflows/README.md`.\r",
			"\r",
			"## When to Use\r",
			"\r",
			"- User asks to generate images with Stable Diffusion, SDXL, Flux, SD3, etc.\r",
			"- User wants to run a specific ComfyUI workflow file\r",
			"- User wants to chain generative steps (txt2img → upscale → face restore)\r",
			"- User needs ControlNet, inpainting, img2img, or other advanced pipelines\r",
			"- User asks to manage ComfyUI queue, check models, or install custom nodes\r",
			"- User wants video/audio/3D generation via AnimateDiff, Hunyuan, Wan, AudioCraft, etc.\r",
			"\r",
			"## Architecture: Two Layers\r",
			"\r",
			"```\r",
			"┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r",
			"│ Layer 1: comfy-cli (official lifecycle tool)        │\r",
			"│   Setup, server lifecycle, custom nodes, models     │\r",
			"│   → comfy install / launch / stop / node / model    │\r",
			"└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┘\r",
			"                          │\r",
			"┌─────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────┐\r",
			"│ Layer 2: REST/WebSocket API + skill scripts         │\r",
			"│   Workflow execution, param injection, monitoring   │\r",
			"│   POST /api/prompt, GET /api/view, WS /ws           │\r",
			"│   → run_workflow.py, run_batch.py, ws_monitor.py    │\r",
			"└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Why two layers?** The official CLI is excellent for installation and server\r",
			"management but has minimal workflow execution support. The REST/WS API fills\r",
			"that gap — the scripts handle param injection, execution monitoring, and\r",
			"output download that the CLI doesn't do.\r",
			"\r",
			"## Quick Start\r",
			"\r",
			"### Detect environment\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"# What's available?\r",
			"command -v comfy >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"comfy-cli: installed\"\r",
