			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## Core Workflow\r",
			"\r",
			"### Step 1: Get a workflow JSON in API format\r",
			"\r",
			"Workflows must be in API format (each node has `class_type`). They come from:\r",
			"\r",
			"- ComfyUI web UI → **Workflow → Export (API)** (newer UI) or\r",
