			"\r",
			"## Decision Tree\r",
			"\r",
			"| User says | Tool | Command |\r",
			"|-----------|------|---------|\r",
			"| **Lifecycle (use comfy-cli)** | | |\r",
			"| \"install ComfyUI\" | comfy-cli | `bash scripts/comfyui_setup.sh` |\r",
			"| \"start ComfyUI\" | comfy-cli | `comfy launch --background` |\r",
			"| \"stop ComfyUI\" | comfy-cli | `comfy stop` |\r",
			"| \"install X node\" | comfy-cli | `comfy node install <name>` |\r",
			"| \"download X model\" | comfy-cli | `comfy model download --url <url> --relative-path models/checkpoints` |\r",
			"| \"list installed models\" | comfy-cli | `comfy model list` |\r",
			"| \"list installed nodes\" | comfy-cli | `comfy node show installed` |\r",
			"| **Execution (use scripts)** | | |\r",
			"| \"is everything ready?\" | script | `health_check.py` (optionally with `--workflow X --smoke-test`) |\r",
