			"| `marginal` | SD1.5 works; SDXL tight; Flux/video unlikely                  | Local OK for light workflows, else **Path A (Cloud)** |\r",
			"| `cloud`    | No usable GPU, <6 GB VRAM, <16 GB Apple unified, Intel Mac, Rosetta Python | **Switch to Cloud** unless user explicitly forces local |\r",
