			"## Feature Description\r",
			"<What you want>\r",
			"\r",
			"## Motivation\r",
			"<Why this would be useful>\r",
			"\r",
			"## Proposed Solution\r",
			"<How it could work>\r",
			"\r",
			"## Alternatives Considered\r",
			"<Other approaches>\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## 3. Managing Issues\r",
			"\r",
			"### Add/Remove Labels\r",
			"\r",
			"**With gh:**\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"gh issue edit 42 --add-label \"priority:high,bug\"\r",
			"gh issue edit 42 --remove-label \"needs-triage\"\r",
