			"\r",
			"**With curl:**\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"curl -s -X POST \\\r",
			"  -H \"Authorization: token $GITHUB_TOKEN\" \\\r",
			"  https://api.github.com/repos/$OWNER/$REPO/issues/42/comments \\\r",
			"  -d '{\"body\": \"Investigated — root cause is in auth middleware. Working on a fix.\"}'\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Closing and Reopening\r",
			"\r",
			"**With gh:**\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
