			"\r",
			"**GitHub Stars**: 22,000+ | **Created By**: Stanford NLP\r",
			"\r",
			"## Installation\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"# Stable release\r",
			"pip install dspy\r",
			"\r",
			"# Latest development version\r",
