			"\r",
			"**View available tasks**:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"lm_eval --tasks list\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## Common workflows\r",
			"\r",
			"### Workflow 1: Standard benchmark evaluation\r",
			"\r",
			"Evaluate model on core benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HumanEval).\r",
			"\r",
			"Copy this checklist:\r",
			"\r",
			"```\r",
			"Benchmark Evaluation:\r",
			"- [ ] Step 1: Choose benchmark suite\r",
			"- [ ] Step 2: Configure model\r",
			"- [ ] Step 3: Run evaluation\r",
			"- [ ] Step 4: Analyze results\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Step 1: Choose benchmark suite**\r",
			"\r",
			"**Core reasoning benchmarks**:\r",
			"- **MMLU** (Massive Multitask Language Understanding) - 57 subjects, multiple choice\r",
			"- **GSM8K** - Grade school math word problems\r",
			"- **HellaSwag** - Common sense reasoning\r",
			"- **TruthfulQA** - Truthfulness and factuality\r",
			"- **ARC** (AI2 Reasoning Challenge) - Science questions\r",
			"\r",
			"**Code benchmarks**:\r",
			"- **HumanEval** - Python code generation (164 problems)\r",
			"- **MBPP** (Mostly Basic Python Problems) - Python coding\r",
			"\r",
			"**Standard suite** (recommended for model releases):\r",
			"```bash\r",
