			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Step 2: Configure model**\r",
			"\r",
			"**HuggingFace model**:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"lm_eval --model hf \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf,dtype=bfloat16 \\\r",
			"  --tasks mmlu \\\r",
			"  --device cuda:0 \\\r",
			"  --batch_size auto  # Auto-detect optimal batch size\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Quantized model (4-bit/8-bit)**:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"lm_eval --model hf \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf,load_in_4bit=True \\\r",
			"  --tasks mmlu \\\r",
			"  --device cuda:0\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Custom checkpoint**:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"lm_eval --model hf \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=/path/to/my-model,tokenizer=/path/to/tokenizer \\\r",
