			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Workflow 2: Track training progress\r",
			"\r",
			"Evaluate checkpoints during training.\r",
			"\r",
			"```\r",
			"Training Progress Tracking:\r",
			"- [ ] Step 1: Set up periodic evaluation\r",
			"- [ ] Step 2: Choose quick benchmarks\r",
			"- [ ] Step 3: Automate evaluation\r",
			"- [ ] Step 4: Plot learning curves\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Step 1: Set up periodic evaluation**\r",
			"\r",
			"Evaluate every N training steps:\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"#!/bin/bash\r",
			"# eval_checkpoint.sh\r",
			"\r",
			"CHECKPOINT_DIR=$1\r",
			"STEP=$2\r",
			"\r",
			"lm_eval --model hf \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=$CHECKPOINT_DIR/checkpoint-$STEP \\\r",
			"  --tasks gsm8k,hellaswag \\\r",
			"  --num_fewshot 0 \\  # 0-shot for speed\r",
			"  --batch_size 16 \\\r",
			"  --output_path results/step-$STEP.json\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Step 2: Choose quick benchmarks**\r",
			"\r",
			"Fast benchmarks for frequent evaluation:\r",
			"- **HellaSwag**: ~10 minutes on 1 GPU\r",
