			"### Workflow 4: Evaluate with vLLM (faster inference)\r",
			"\r",
			"Use vLLM backend for 5-10x faster evaluation.\r",
			"\r",
			"```\r",
			"vLLM Evaluation:\r",
			"- [ ] Step 1: Install vLLM\r",
			"- [ ] Step 2: Configure vLLM backend\r",
			"- [ ] Step 3: Run evaluation\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Step 1: Install vLLM**\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"pip install vllm\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Step 2: Configure vLLM backend**\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"lm_eval --model vllm \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf,tensor_parallel_size=1,dtype=auto,gpu_memory_utilization=0.8 \\\r",
			"  --tasks mmlu \\\r",
			"  --batch_size auto\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Step 3: Run evaluation**\r",
			"\r",
			"vLLM is 5-10× faster than standard HuggingFace:\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"# Standard HF: ~2 hours for MMLU on 7B model\r",
			"lm_eval --model hf \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf \\\r",
			"  --tasks mmlu \\\r",
			"  --batch_size 8\r",
			"\r",
			"# vLLM: ~15-20 minutes for MMLU on 7B model\r",
			"lm_eval --model vllm \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf,tensor_parallel_size=2 \\\r",
			"  --tasks mmlu \\\r",
			"  --batch_size auto\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## When to use vs alternatives\r",
			"\r",
			"**Use lm-evaluation-harness when:**\r",
			"- Benchmarking models for academic papers\r",
			"- Comparing model quality across standard tasks\r",
			"- Tracking training progress\r",
			"- Reporting standardized metrics (everyone uses same prompts)\r",
			"- Need reproducible evaluation\r",
			"\r",
			"**Use alternatives instead:**\r",
			"- **HELM** (Stanford): Broader evaluation (fairness, efficiency, calibration)\r",
			"- **AlpacaEval**: Instruction-following evaluation with LLM judges\r",
			"- **MT-Bench**: Conversational multi-turn evaluation\r",
			"- **Custom scripts**: Domain-specific evaluation\r",
			"\r",
			"## Common issues\r",
			"\r",
			"**Issue: Evaluation too slow**\r",
			"\r",
			"Use vLLM backend:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"lm_eval --model vllm \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=model-name,tensor_parallel_size=2\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Or reduce fewshot examples:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"--num_fewshot 0  # Instead of 5\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Or evaluate subset of MMLU:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"--tasks mmlu_stem  # Only STEM subjects\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Issue: Out of memory**\r",
			"\r",
			"Reduce batch size:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"--batch_size 1  # Or --batch_size auto\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Use quantization:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"--model_args pretrained=model-name,load_in_8bit=True\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Enable CPU offloading:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"--model_args pretrained=model-name,device_map=auto,offload_folder=offload\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Issue: Different results than reported**\r",
			"\r",
			"Check fewshot count:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"--num_fewshot 5  # Most papers use 5-shot\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Check exact task name:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"--tasks mmlu  # Not mmlu_direct or mmlu_fewshot\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Verify model and tokenizer match:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"--model_args pretrained=model-name,tokenizer=same-model-name\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"**Issue: HumanEval not executing code**\r",
			"\r",
			"Install execution dependencies:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"pip install human-eval\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Enable code execution:\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"lm_eval --model hf \\\r",
			"  --model_args pretrained=model-name \\\r",
			"  --tasks humaneval \\\r",
			"  --allow_code_execution  # Required for HumanEval\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## Advanced topics\r",
