			"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8fG9BrNTeHs (\"OBLITERATUS: An AI Agent Removed Gemma 4's Safety Guardrails\")\r",
			"\r",
			"Useful when the user wants a visual overview of the end-to-end workflow before running it themselves.\r",
			"\r",
			"## When to Use This Skill\r",
			"\r",
