			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"## Step 4: Choose a Method\r",
			"\r",
			"### Method Selection Guide\r",
			"**Default / recommended for most cases: `advanced`.** It uses multi-direction SVD with norm-preserving projection and is well-tested.\r",
			"\r",
			"| Situation                         | Recommended Method | Why                                      |\r",
			"|:----------------------------------|:-------------------|:-----------------------------------------|\r",
			"| Default / most models             | `advanced`         | Multi-direction SVD, norm-preserving, reliable |\r",
			"| Quick test / prototyping          | `basic`            | Fast, simple, good enough to evaluate    |\r",
			"| Dense model (Llama, Mistral)      | `advanced`         | Multi-direction, norm-preserving         |\r",
			"| MoE model (DeepSeek, Mixtral)     | `nuclear`          | Expert-granular, handles MoE complexity  |\r",
			"| Reasoning model (R1 distills)     | `surgical`         | CoT-aware, preserves chain-of-thought    |\r",
			"| Stubborn refusals persist         | `aggressive`       | Whitened SVD + head surgery + jailbreak   |\r",
			"| Want reversible changes           | Use steering vectors (see Analysis section) |\r",
