			"directions from the search point), and promoted tags when available —\r",
			"`cuisine`, `hours` (opening_hours), `phone`, `website`.\r",
			"\r",
			"### distance — Travel distance and time\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"python3 $MAPS distance \"Paris\" --to \"Lyon\"\r",
			"python3 $MAPS distance \"New York\" --to \"Boston\" --mode driving\r",
			"python3 $MAPS distance \"Big Ben\" --to \"Tower Bridge\" --mode walking\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Modes: driving (default), walking, cycling. Returns road distance, duration,\r",
			"and straight-line distance for comparison.\r",
			"\r",
			"### directions — Turn-by-turn navigation\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"python3 $MAPS directions \"Eiffel Tower\" --to \"Louvre Museum\" --mode walking\r",
