			"   NOTION_API_KEY=ntn_your_key_here\r",
			"   ```\r",
			"4. **Share target pages/databases with the integration** in Notion: page menu `...` → `Connect to` → your integration name. Without this, the API returns 404 for that page even though it exists.\r",
			"\r",
			"### 2. Install `ntn` (preferred path on macOS / Linux)\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"# Recommended\r",
			"curl -fsSL https://ntn.dev | bash\r",
