			"  ntn api v1/data_sources/{data_source_id}/query -X POST --json -\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### File uploads (one-liner — biggest CLI win)\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"ntn files create < photo.png\r",
			"ntn files create --external-url https://example.com/photo.png\r",
			"ntn files list\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"Compare to the 3-step HTTP flow (create upload → PUT bytes → reference).\r",
			"\r",
			"### Useful env vars\r",
			"| Var | Effect |\r",
			"|---|---|\r",
			"| `NOTION_API_TOKEN` | Auth token (overrides keychain) — set this to your integration token |\r",
			"| `NOTION_KEYRING=0` | File-based creds at `~/.config/notion/auth.json` instead of OS keychain |\r",
			"| `NOTION_WORKSPACE_ID` | Skip the workspace picker prompt |\r",
			"\r",
			"## Path B — HTTP + curl (cross-platform, default on Windows)\r",
			"\r",
			"All requests share this pattern:\r",
			"\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"curl -s -X GET \"https://api.notion.com/v1/...\" \\\r",
