			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"On Windows the `curl` shipped with Windows 10+ works as-is. PowerShell users can also use `Invoke-RestMethod`.\r",
			"\r",
			"### Search\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"curl -s -X POST \"https://api.notion.com/v1/search\" \\\r",
			"  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NOTION_API_KEY\" \\\r",
			"  -H \"Notion-Version: 2025-09-03\" \\\r",
			"  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\r",
			"  -d '{\"query\": \"page title\"}'\r",
			"```\r",
			"\r",
			"### Read page metadata\r",
			"```bash\r",
			"curl -s \"https://api.notion.com/v1/pages/{page_id}\" \\\r",
